     PERFORM ADD-N
     COMPUTE WS-SHOW ROUNDED = (WS-FD) * 1000000
     PERFORM ADD-N
     COMPUTE WS-SHOW ROUNDED = (WS-FE) * 1000000
     PERFORM ADD-N
